{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miona.hori/img/blog/miona.hori/img/2016/01/20/0131885/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miona.hori/img/blog/miona.hori/img/2016/01/20/0131885/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miona.hori/img/blog/miona.hori/img/2016/01/20/0131885/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明太子、解凍待ち〜\n待ちきれへん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明太子に関係のない話ですが\n今日スタッフさんのシャープペンシルの\n先っちょの消しゴムカバーを\nいつの間にか無くしてしまい本当に\n申し訳ない気持ちでいっぱい。\nずっと引きづっています...\nどこ行ったのかなぁ？\n心がもやもや。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんへ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"個別握手会で\nこんな感じの洋服着てほしい！\nこんな髪型してほしい！\nこれのコスプレが見たい！\nなど皆さんのリクエストに\n応えていこうと思います。\nたーくさん応えます。\nコメントにて、是非教えて下さい(^^)/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miona.hori/img/blog/miona.hori/img/2016/01/20/0131885/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miona.hori/img/blog/miona.hori/img/2016/01/20/0131885/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと、質問も募集しようかな！\n色んな質問に沢山答えますっ\n待っとるね〜(ﾉ)・ω・(ヾ)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miona.hori/img/blog/miona.hori/img/2016/01/20/0131885/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほっかほかの白米と明太子\n早く食べたいな〜\nでも解凍には時間がかかるみたい...\nもう、おねむです。\n今日は寝ます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日会おうね、明太子ちゃんっ♡\nおやすみおな"}],"source":"archive"}